WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
Factorising shares the tiles into equal rows.

2
00:00:04.376 --> 00:00:07.026
Six x tiles and nine ones.

3
00:00:07.577 --> 00:00:11.552
Two rows do not work: nine ones do not share into two.

4
00:00:13.854 --> 00:00:17.904
Three rows of two x plus three. That is the bracket.
